        {
          "en": "By appending a brief etc to long lists, reports stay readable without losing the open-ended meaning.",
          "highlight": [
            "etc"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "長列舉後面附上簡短的「等等」二字，可在不失開放語意的情況下讓報告更易讀。"
